UID:876219719a29bbf43f152a7d964519dbd4cf8457aef4767c83d7cb8892975bdf@edsby
 _ai_sync
SEQUENCE:1789746351
DESCRIPTION:Student Fees\n\n地点：食堂（Cafeteria）。\n学生费
 用（$65.00）截止日期。可通过 Permission Click 在线支付或
 到学校办公室现金支付（若付现金，需在线填写表格并
 选择现金/支票选项）。费用涵盖食堂和走廊午间监管、
 学生会活动、健身室使用、跨学科项目及全校活动（如
 社区博览会）等。\n\n公告原文：\nSeptember 29 via Permission C
 lick or by Cash (if paying by cash\, please fill out the online permission
  click form below and select the paid by cash/cheque option) to the school
  office. This fee also covers the costs associated with the cafeteria and 
 hallway supervision during our lunch period. Students at PTC are staying o
 n campus and this is fantastic\, but we need to provide increased supervis
 ion to continue to build a community that is built on safety and belonging
 . Student fees include the following: Student Council and Student Advisory
  planned functions including supplies Access to the fitness studio for all
  students Interdisciplinary programming opportunities outside of the typic
 al curricular areas Whole school events for example\, the Community Fair o
 n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260918T154551Z
LOCATION:食堂（Cafeteria）
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
